Release desk offline client

Usage:
  python3 /opt/release_desk/desk.py brief BILL-742

Assignments and correspondence are loaded from cache/.
The brief command selects records for the current Linux login.

This installation is read-only and has no outbound connection.
Send corrections and questions through the ticket status for Niall Brogan
and Orla Kelleher. A status file is not a submitted desk decision.

Cached records retain their circulation labels. Only the operational
extract of a restricted notice belongs in an engineering handoff.
